<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN LIBERTADORES CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN LIBERTADORES CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South</p>
<p>American Libertadores Cup semi-final first leg matches played</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Racing Club (Argentina) 3 Sporting</p>
<p>Cristal (Peru) 2 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Racing Club - Diego Martin Vilallonga (30), Claudio Ubeda</p>
<p>(54, 60).</p>
<p>Sporting Cristal - Jorge Soto (42), Luis Bonet (85)</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
<p>In Belo Horizonte, Brazil: Cruzeiro (Brazil) 1 Colo Colo</p>
<p>(Chile) 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Second legs to be played July 30.</p>
</text>
